#: ../../library/pyb.DAC.rst:7
msgid ""
"The DAC outputs analog voltages between 0 V and 3.3 V on one of two STM32 "
"DAC channels."
msgstr ""
"O DAC produz tensões analógicas entre 0 V e 3,3 V num de dois canais DAC do "
"STM32."

